        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Tanya Donelly, Kristin Hersh, Trace Cyrus, Kim Deal\n- Bands: Throwing Muses, The Breeders, Pixies\n- Albums: Limbo\n- Companies: Rykodisc\n\nFacts:\n- Tanya Donelly was born on July 14, 1966, in Newport, Rhode Island.\n- Tanya Donelly is an American Grammy Award-nominated singer-songwriter and guitarist based in New England.\n- Tanya Donelly co-founded Throwing Muses with her stepsister Kristin Hersh.\n- Trace Cyrus was born Neil Timothy Helson on February 24, 1989.\n- Trace Cyrus is an American musician.\n- The Breeders are an American alternative rock band formed in 1989 by Kim Deal of the Pixies and Tanya Donelly of Throwing Muses.\n- Limbo is a 1996 album by the American alternative rock band Throwing Muses.\n- Rykodisc released Limbo.",
